%SIXMD 1
# @?RMDIR - REMOVE DIRECTORIES

## @?OPERANDS

### @?DIR ...
ONE OR MORE EMPTY DIRECTORIES TO REMOVE.

## DESCRIPTION

RMDIR REMOVES EACH NAMED DIRECTORY THROUGH THE NATIVE VFS INTERFACE.
USAGE IS 'RMDIR DIR ...'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
